    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The store accepts the return and sends the paid $40 back to the buyer. The $40 return is a <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="refund" data-hint="Choose the noun for money returned after payment." data-fix="The buyer receives a $40 refund.">choose</button>.</span></div>
