    <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span>The supplier adds $18 specifically for transporting the projector. The added amount is a <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="delivery fee" data-hint="Choose the charge tied to the delivery service." data-fix="The supplier adds an $18 delivery fee.">choose</button>.</span></div>
